Particle Rain for Sunrise 26.3 (version 0.5.0)

A port of Particle Rain by PigCart.
Original source: https://github.com/PigCart/particle-rain
Original licence: MIT

Ported to Sunrise by arismoko: the weather particle system, wind simulation, sprite
splitting/generation, sound controls, commands, F3 debug entries, and configuration are
implemented in Rust on Sunrise's typed mod API (no Java code is included). This port is
distributed under the same licence as the original (MIT); the licence text is in LICENSE.

The mod icon (`icon.png`), particle textures (`assets/particlerain/textures/particle/`),
weather sounds (`assets/particlerain/sounds/weather/` and `sounds.json`), and translations
(`assets/particlerain/lang/`) are carried from the original MIT-licensed repository.
